                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "As a member of the @NewDemCoalition, one of my top priorities is making health care more affordable for everyone.\n\nThat's why I'm proud to support our newly released Health Care Action Plan, a framework for lowering costs and expanding care for all Americans.\n\nRead it here \u27a1\ufe0fhttps://t.co/aF5XdDrg0E",
