                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "As life becomes more expensive under President Trump, one thing the American people certainly can\u2019t afford is more Republican inaction on health care.\n\nIt\u2019s time for Republicans to finally find some courage and join Democrats in lowering health care costs before premiums skyrocket.",
